  bx('ye', '<b>Source conflict (handout alert):</b> Main Features list says composition limit <b>₹100 lakh</b>; composition paragraph says <b>₹75 lakh</b> (₹50 lakh in a few States). Not reconciled. <b>Rule:</b> if both options appear, pick the one matching the wording (₹75 lakh with composition paragraph); if only one, use it.'),
  t('<b>GSTN</b>', 'incorporated <b>March 2013</b>, <b>Section 25</b> private limited company, paid-up capital <b>₹10 crore</b>', 'equity: earlier Centre, States <b>and private sector</b>; <b>now fully government</b>', 'common pass-through portal: registration, returns, payment; <b>Infosys</b> = Managed Service Provider (MSP); <b>73 GST Suvidha Providers</b>', w=18),
